7390448", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/654867655_1543374170723781_6943246021799121569_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ksl_ZnluunMQ7kNvwGKErVC&_nc_oc=AdoOm7EKTxIhJKAhyz6UGM-OW2UnKrcWGnhS5Wh1mY161bmU4DekinZ1IqhbCLWKtZQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBMXluDSGBMtIvt0C-qlwiufXTDWfwdEfImEb8-uFe8Cg&oe=6A5F79C1"}, {"file_name": "com.medvr.HVACBoilerInspectionMaintenance-20260709-184558.png", "id": "1580336753431927", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499624983_1580336756765260_5960406402915855776_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2Vj3yRhTIpsQ7kNvwHBuZij&_nc_oc=AdrAsg0Q5IYAMOYiMfTl1GbLKUZmS5WKfjIxDNu4g0wl2cxjUj8rAG3WmsCQsPtUb04&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCBEzTrqeRYBcMw-xD8-i0N82Qr0UZI9LKzp1814QXwHg&oe=6A5F7A06"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "HVAC Boiler Inspection & Maintenance", "keywords": [], "long_description": "HVAC Boiler Inspection & Maintenance is the official virtual reality training application for the ImmerseLearn HVAC Boiler Inspection & Maintenance Micro-Credential Program. Designed to complement instructor-led and online learning, this immersive simulation enables learners to develop practical skills in a safe, interactive environment.\n\nThrough realistic hands-on scenarios, learners practice boiler inspection procedures, preventive maintenance tasks, component identification, safety protocols, operational checks, and basic troubleshooting techniques while following industry best practices.\n\nImportant:  This application is not a standalone training product. It is available exclusively to individuals enrolled in the ImmerseLearn HVAC Boiler Inspection & Maintenance Micro-Credential Program. Only authorized learners with program access can use this application as part of their required hands-on VR training.", "short_description": "HVAC Boiler Inspection 